    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STORY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the MAD program, two top-tier college professors, Darren and C\u00e2i, are the ultimate coding duo! Darren is a master of the Swipe programming language, while C\u00e2i is a wizard of the\u00a0Brew programming language. One day, just as Darren is about to start his morning lecture\u2014BZZT!\u2014every computer in the lab goes haywire!\u00a0C\u00e2i storms in and reports\u00a0the same issue in his classroom. Legendary professor Peter arrives with alarming news: the Calamity Virus has awakened from its 100-year seal, and it's time for its chaos to spread!\u00a0With Peter freshly retired, it\u2019s up to Darren and C\u00e2i to descend into the basement\u2019s basement\u2014a place so deep it might not even have Wi-Fi! Their mission? Debug the Code Calamity before it crashes everything for good!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705100/extras/dfbdfee45a23c4b6d5727be57f915ae6.avif?t=1747921300\" width=696 height=378 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >OVERWORLD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between battles and puzzles, you'll explore the interconnected areas of the MAD program's lowest levels: the basement's basement. The overworld is designed as a series of indoor areas with  environmental challenges that evolve as you progress. Some areas are initially locked and require solving nearby Terminals or progressing the story to access.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will control both C\u00e2i and Darren, with the ability to switch between them at any time to lead the group. Each character can interact with specific Terminals found throughout the environment. To solve puzzles linked to their respective Terminals, you'll need to alternate between C\u00e2i and Darren.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705100/extras/d8ab8745c1189931ef9f20a307521ab6.poster.avif?t=1747921300\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705100/extras/d8ab8745c1189931ef9f20a307521ab6.webm?t=1747921300\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705100/extras/d8ab8745c1189931ef9f20a307521ab6.mp4?t=1747921300\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705100/extras/b9aa4dc02a2739d51979145f6a681db1.poster.avif?t=1747921300\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705100/extras/b9aa4dc02a2739d51979145f6a681db1.webm?t=1747921300\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705100/extras/b9aa4dc02a2739d51979145f6a681db1.mp4?t=1747921300\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PUZZLES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout the basement's basement, you will encounter various<strong>\u00a0Terminals</strong>. These terminals control various systems of the basement's basement, such as conveyor belts, doors, and gates. In order to manipulate these systems, the terminals need to be reprogrammed. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >C\u00e2i and Darren each specialize in a different programming language: C\u00e2i knows\u00a0<strong>Brew</strong> and Darren knows\u00a0<strong>Swipe</strong>. You'll reprogram terminals by switching between professors to write programs using these languages, each with unique syntax rules. Swipe is written more<i> naturally</i>, while Brew is more<i> symbolic.\u00a0</i>The two languages are designed to be similar, but with subtle differences that challenge the player\u2019s attention to detail and understanding of basic programming logic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705100/extras/ccad59e10ce136b35a5fd0ff1dc40189.poster.avif?t=1747921300\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705100/extras/ccad59e10ce136b35a5fd0ff1dc40189.webm?t=1747921300\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705100/extras/ccad59e10ce136b35a5fd0ff1dc40189.mp4?t=1747921300\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705100/extras/fb6eace384685ccf491e5e49b8707d69.poster.avif?t=1747921300\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705100/extras/fb6eace384685ccf491e5e49b8707d69.webm?t=1747921300\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705100/extras/fb6eace384685ccf491e5e49b8707d69.mp4?t=1747921300\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BATTLE SYSTEM</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Code Calamity has commanded his errors and warnings to roam the basement's basement in search of intruders! Coming into contact with them will initiate a battle, wherein you will use your deck of <strong>Battle Chips</strong> to uniquely engage in combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the start of your journey, Peter provides you with a set of <strong>Battle Chips</strong>\u2014powerful tools used in combat that have various effects, such as damaging enemies, bolstering defenses, and restoring health. While many Battle Chips offer helpful effects, some come with risks or drawbacks, requiring strategic use.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705100/extras/b4012014956460c957ae462233e04450.poster.avif?t=1747921300\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705100/extras/b4012014956460c957ae462233e04450.webm?t=1747921300\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705100/extras/b4012014956460c957ae462233e04450.mp4?t=1747921300\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705100/extras/e3512e1a8e71279c424caf4fff7bba92.poster.avif?t=1747921300\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705100/extras/e3512e1a8e71279c424caf4fff7bba92.webm?t=1747921300\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705100/extras/e3512e1a8e71279c424caf4fff7bba92.mp4?t=1747921300\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>When you choose \u201c<strong>Attack</strong>\u201d, five Battle Chips are randomly drawn from your deck. At the same time, each chip is assigned a random label from <strong>A to D</strong>. Chips sharing the same label can be used together in a single turn, allowing you to <strong>stack their effects.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705100/extras/2515e644380ec12a6ab0e20bb0a346ed.poster.avif?t=1747921300\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705100/extras/2515e644380ec12a6ab0e20bb0a346ed.webm?t=1747921300\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705100/extras/2515e644380ec12a6ab0e20bb0a346ed.mp4?t=1747921300\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can choose which battle chips appear in battles in the pause menu. Clicking on a chip will toggle it between <strong>TRUE</strong> or <strong>FALSE</strong>. Chips labelled  \u201c<strong>FALSE</strong>\u201d will not be used.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > NICK'S SHOP</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout your adventure you'll meet<strong> Nick,</strong> a clumsy professor who live's in the basement's basement. He's running a side-gig selling extra<strong>\u00a0Battle Chips</strong> and<strong> Items</strong>. You can return to him at any point to purchase new chips to help you turn the tide of battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705100/extras/ef0da5f893900db6857ea474597336f7.poster.avif?t=1747921300\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705100/extras/ef0da5f893900db6857ea474597336f7.webm?t=1747921300\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705100/extras/ef0da5f893900db6857ea474597336f7.mp4?t=1747921300\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
