. While many Battle Chips offer helpful effects, some come with risks or drawbacks, requiring strategic use.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705100/extras/b4012014956460c957ae462233e04450.poster.avif?t=1747921300\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705100/extras/b4012014956460c957ae462233e04450.webm?t=1747921300\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705100/extras/b4012014956460c957ae462233e04450.mp4?t=1747921300\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705100/extras/e3512e1a8e71279c424caf4fff7bba92.poster.avif?t=1747921300\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705100/extras/e3512e1a8e71279c424caf4fff7bba92.webm?t=1747921300\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705100/extras/e3512e1a8e71279c424caf4fff7bba92.mp4?t=1747921300\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>When you choose \u201c<strong>Attack</strong>\u201d, five Battle Chips are randomly drawn from your deck. At the same time, each chip is assigned a random label from <strong>A to D</strong>. Chips sharing the same label can be used together in a single turn, allowing you to <strong>stack their effects.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3705100/extras/2515e644380ec12a6ab0e20bb0a346ed.poster.avif?t=1747921300\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https: